1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,800
LADY ASHCROFT: ...that belongs to this family.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,800
JULIANA: It belonged to my mother! It is all I have left of her.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
LADY ASHCROFT: Then you should have guarded it better.

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,800
JULIANA: Barbara, don't!

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,500
CLARISSA: Even your mother's precious legacy has been cast into the dirt!

6
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,600
GERALD: Perhaps that is where it belongs.

7
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:33,000
MYSTERIOUS BEARDED MAN: Here you go.

8
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,000
JULIANA: They destroyed it.

9
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,400
MYSTERIOUS BEARDED MAN: They dirtied it. That is not the same thing.

10
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,800
JULIANA: It was my mother's.

11
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,000
MYSTERIOUS BEARDED MAN: Then keep it.

12
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:45,000
MYSTERIOUS BEARDED MAN: Let them keep everything else.

13
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,800
GERALD: Look at you.

14
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,500
GERALD: A noblewoman reduced to a beggar's wife!

15
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,800
MYSTERIOUS BEARDED MAN: Choose your next words carefully.
